# tmd-cli
===
 A plugin-based, multi-CLI desktop client featuring a native terminal interface and a rich-input composer. It unifies the operation of ten CLIs—omp, pi, kimi, codex, claude, grok, qoder, qoder-cn, dsh, and opencode—and offers first-class support for SSH remote sessions, complemented by a native mobile app and browser-based remote access (via direct LAN connection, Cloudflare, or self-hosted relay).
